0.114	step	node tools/test_flora_travel_commit.mjs 	Nearby plants keep up during continuous horseback travel
0.107	step	node tools/check_chromebook.mjs 	A classroom Chromebook boots as a computer on the memory diet, people and teams kept, and is offered Prepare for class (T-3675)
6.606	selftest	node tools/prebuild_layers.mjs --self-test --layer ground 	The ground's tiles cut in Node are byte-identical build to build, batch exactly as the page's own spatialBatch does, and a prebuild from changed inputs is refused (T-2692)
0.078	step	node tools/calibrate_boot_weights.mjs --check 	boot-weights.js re-derives from the reference reading and its calibration receipt (T-2060)
0.061	step	node tools/test_work_day_source.mjs 	1812 visible work follows real normalized primary day jobs and historical presence (T-3551)
0.059	step	node tools/test_recall.mjs 	The way home: All destinations and Recall ask first, Cancel/Esc stay put, Return runs the reverse ring and stamps the trip, reduced motion skips the ring (T-2735)
0.044	step	node tools/test_viewport_accessibility.mjs 	Browser magnification preserves viewport size and independent movement and look controls (T-3658)
0.308	step	node tools/test_selected_year.mjs 	Selected-year arrival and catalog isolation (T-1767)
12.102	step	node tools/test_sign_in.mjs 	The sign-in gate asks only where it is switched on, never locks a visitor out, and writes only what its Firestore rules allow (T-3576)
0.068	step	node tools/test_person_interactions.mjs 	Walking people keep their Interact menu, explicit picks persist, and dismissal releases them (T-3543)
17.227	step	python3 tools/test_human_lady_1904.py 	A 1904 lady's day dress is sourced, layered and skinned on the shared rig (T-3447)
0.715	step	python3 tools/test_human_source_normals.py 	Resident body normals share exact source seams without welding geometry or UVs (T-1789)
23.602	selftest	node tools/check_jaunt_views.mjs --self-test 	The jaunt-view gate sees a stop behind a trunk when the stand-off rule is not told of the trees (T-3263)
0.372	step	node tools/test_human_camera_fit.mjs 	Resident inspection camera fits geometry below the header without moving the subject
0.144	step	node tools/lay_driven_wagons_1835.mjs --check 	The 1835 town's ten wagons' rows are what their layer writes: one district each, their teamsters, stops and hours (T-3558)
0.226	step	python3 docs/RESEARCH/people-1812-3462/place.py --check 	The 1812 garrison's instance records are what place.py writes (T-3462, T-3490)
1.615	step	python3 tools/test_standing_horse_anatomy_v2.py 	Selected horse anatomy reproduces the authored source and protects rig, eye maps and skin ancestry (T-3088)
0.772	step	node tools/test_town_people_1871.mjs 	1871's people stand on the context city's walks at their own doors, most out on the Sunday afternoon, and each wagon is led by its carded driver (T-3690)
12.883	step	node tools/test_human_skin.mjs 	Every person's skin has pores, blood and a glow, hair a strand sheen and eyes a wet glint: shader patch, no texture (T-3400)
1.172	step	python3 tools/photo_face_library.py --check assets/humans/web/photo_faces/children/review.json 	Child photo sources, untouched child shapes and bounded atlas pages reproduce (T-3768)
0.146	step	node tools/test_person_interaction.mjs 	Every person placed in town is named by the look tag, found, and followed beside them (T-3404)
